## Technical Notes

- Exit duration: 200-300ms (quick)
- Easing: ease-in (vs ease-out for entrance)
- All elements animate simultaneously (no stagger)
- After exit completes, automatically restart entrance
- Click during entrance can optionally restart or skip to exit
